  "notes": [
    "Reflexive form of *parecer*; irregular -ER verb with c→zc change before *a/o*",
    "Irregular yo present: *me parezco* (c→zc); subjuntivo stem: *parezc-*",
    "Past participle: *parecido*",
    "*parecerse a alguien* = to look like / to resemble someone (*Me parezco mucho a mi madre* — I look a lot like my mother)",
    "*parecerse en algo* = to be alike in something (*Se parecen en el carácter* — They are alike in character)",
    "Distinct from *parecer* (non-reflexive) = to seem/appear (*Me parece bien* — It seems fine to me)"
  ],
